      "to": "田銀",
      "type": "personal",
      "polarity": "negative",
      "directed": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9c-p6",
          "text": {
            "en": "When Su Bo and Tian Yin rebelled, Cao Ren commanded seven armies against them and defeated them.",
            "zht": "蘇伯、田銀造反，曹仁都督七軍將他們擊破。",
            "zhs": "苏伯、田银造反，曹仁都督七军将他们击破。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
