      "polarity": "negative",
      "directed": true,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9c-p6",
          "text": {
            "en": "When Hou Yin rebelled at Wan, Cao Ren led the armies against him, defeated him and beheaded him.",
            "zht": "侯音據宛城叛亂，曹仁率軍將他擊破並斬首。",
            "zhs": "侯音据宛城叛乱，曹仁率军将他击破并斩首。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "曹仁（子孝）",
      "to": "關羽（雲長）",
      "type": "personal",
      "polarity": "negative",
      "directed": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9c-p6",
          "text": {
            "en": "With Fancheng surrounded by floodwaters and by Guan Yu's boats, Cao Ren held the city with a few thousand men until Xu Huang's relief let him break out, and Guan Yu withdrew.",
            "zht": "樊城被洪水和關羽的戰船重重包圍，曹仁以數千人堅守，直到徐晃援軍到來才突圍而出，關羽撤退。",
            "zhs": "樊城被洪水和关羽的战船重重包围，曹仁以数千人坚守，直到徐晃援军到来才突围而出，关羽撤退。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "曹仁（子孝）",
      "to": "徐晃（公明）",
      "type": "colleagues",
      "polarity": "positive",
      "directed": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9c-p6",
          "text": {
            "en": "Xu Huang's relief force attacked Guan Yu from outside, allowing Cao Ren to break out of Fancheng.",
            "zht": "徐晃援軍從外圍進攻關羽，使曹仁得以突圍出城。",
            "zhs": "徐晃援军从外围进攻关羽，使曹仁得以突围出城。"
          }
        },
        {
          "passageId": "ws9c-p8",
          "text": {
            "en": "Cao Ren and Xu Huang defeated Sun Quan's general Chen Shao and entered Xiangyang.",
            "zht": "曹仁與徐晃擊敗孫權部將陳邵，進入襄陽。",
            "zhs": "曹仁与徐晃击败孙权部将陈邵，进入襄阳。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "曹仁（子孝）",
      "to": "陳邵",
      "type": "personal",
      "polarity": "negative",
      "directed": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9c-p8",
          "text": {
            "en": "When Sun Quan's general Chen Shao occupied Xiangyang, Cao Ren was ordered to attack him and, with Xu Huang, defeated him.",
            "zht": "孫權部將陳邵佔據襄陽，曹仁奉詔討伐，與徐晃一同將他擊敗。",
            "zhs": "孙权部将陈邵占据襄阳，曹仁奉诏讨伐，与徐晃一同将他击败。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
