    {
      "from": "曹純（子和）",
      "to": "曹操（孟德）",
      "type": "service",
      "polarity": "positive",
      "directed": true,
      "notes": [
        {
          "passageId": "ws9c-p9",
          "text": {
            "en": "At eighteen Cao Chun became a Gentleman of the Yellow Gates, and at twenty he followed Cao Cao to Xiangyi to recruit troops, thereafter accompanying him on campaign.",
            "zht": "曹純十八歲任黃門侍郎，二十歲隨曹操到襄邑募兵，從此常隨征戰。",
            "zhs": "曹纯十八岁任黄门侍郎，二十岁随曹操到襄邑募兵，从此常随征战。"
          }
        },
        {
          "passageId": "ws9c-p9",
          "text": {
            "en": "Cao Chun served as Gentleman Consultant assisting the Excellency of Works on military affairs, and commanded the Tiger and Leopard Cavalry.",
            "zht": "曹純以議郎身份參司空軍事，統率虎豹騎。",
            "zhs": "曹纯以议郎身份参司空军事，统率虎豹骑。"
          },
          "title": {
            "en": "Gentleman Consultant",
            "zht": "議郎",
            "zhs": "议郎"
          }
        },
        {
          "passageId": "ws9c-p9",
          "text": {
            "en": "At Nanpi, Cao Chun dissuaded Cao Cao from easing the attack, and his horsemen cut off Yuan Tan's head.",
            "zht": "在南皮，曹純勸阻曹操放緩攻勢，其部下騎兵斬殺了袁譚。",
            "zhs": "在南皮，曹纯劝阻曹操放缓攻势，其部下骑兵斩杀了袁谭。"
          }
        },
        {
          "passageId": "ws9c-p9",
          "text": {
            "en": "For his successive achievements, Cao Chun was enfeoffed as Neighbourhood Marquis of Gaoling with three hundred households.",
            "zht": "曹純因前後戰功，被封爲高陵亭侯，食邑三百戶。",
            "zhs": "曹纯因前后战功，被封为高陵亭侯，食邑三百户。"
          },
          "title": {
            "en": "Neighbourhood Marquis of Gaoling",
            "zht": "高陵亭侯",
            "zhs": "高陵亭侯"
          }
        },
        {
          "passageId": "ws9c-p9",
          "text": {
            "en": "After Cao Chun died, Cao Cao found no one fit to replace him at the head of the Tiger and Leopard Cavalry and declared he would command it himself.",
            "zht": "曹純去世後，曹操認爲無人能接替他統率虎豹騎，說道：“難道我不配當督嗎！”便不再另選。",
            "zhs": "曹纯去世后，曹操认为无人能接替他统率虎豹骑，说道：“难道我不配当督吗！”便不再另选。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
